# React & Styling Conventions

1. Use Radix UI primitives and Tailwind CSS tokens (e.g., `bg-background`, `text-foreground`, `border-border`).
2. Do not hardcode colors or magic constants.
3. Wrap async database operations in TanStack React Query (`useQuery`, `useMutation`).
4. Ensure i18n keys are added to both `zh.json` and `en.json`.
5. Respect macOS overlay titlebars with appropriate header spacing.
